omarchy-osk is a modified version of wvkbd, branched from upstream commit
bbecd99 ("Fix segmentation fault after hiding the keyboard"). It was changed
in C starting 2026-10-16 and then translated to Rust (src/); `git log
bbecd99..` lists every change, and the tag c-version is the last C version.
As a translation it remains a derivative work of wvkbd under the same
license.

The word lists in dict/ are adapted from FrequencyWords and licensed under
CC BY-SA 4.0, see dict/README.md.

The layout data in data/layouts, data/locales and data/languages.txt comes
from HeliBoard (GPL-3.0), some of it from FlorisBoard (Apache-2.0), see
data/README.md.

tests/proto/wlr-virtual-pointer-unstable-v1.xml (and the code generated from
it) is Copyright © 2019 Josef Gajdusek under the MIT license in the file.

The Rust crates this is built with (Cargo.lock) are not part of this
repository; they are under MIT and/or Apache-2.0 compatible licenses.

All other code in this repository falls under the terms of the GPL v3.0 license,
which can be found in LICENSE.
